description: "Drive, connect and extend formcut's MCP server (34 formcut_* tools over stdio, built into the app as formcut-engine --mcp, driving the formcut that is running). Use whenever an agent should build, edit, render or collect a formcut video project through MCP; when connecting it to Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Claude Desktop, VS Code or another MCP client; when a formcut tool call fails, the engine is not answering, the tools do not show up, or an edit is refused for a stale revision; or when adding, renaming or changing a formcut MCP tool. Trigger on formcut MCP, formcut_mcp.py, formcut_status, formcut_add_clip, formcut_edit, formcut_render, render a formcut project from an agent, cut or assemble a video with MCP, rough cut by scenes, connect formcut to Claude, Codex or Cursor, formcut-engine --mcp, engine.json, FORMCUT_ENGINE, or stale revision, even when MCP is not named. Route through the mcp-director sub-skill by default."
