      "prompt": "Turn ~/Desktop/spring-issue (slow-craft.md, field-notes.docx and some photos) into a 6-page magazine feature for Northlight, warm and elegant, cream paper, orange accent #f97316. Save it and give me a PDF.",
      "files": [],
